    "created_at": "2016-11-11T17:05:07Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-11T17:05:07Z",
    "body": "Update: turns out the correct way to describe the alternative is:\n1. Let _assigned slot_ be the context object's assigned slot.\n2. If _assigned slot_ is null, return null.\n3. If _assigned slot_ is closed-shadow-hidden from the context object, return null.\n4. Return _assigned slot_.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
